@startuml
title SYS01 - Successful deployment with isolated PostgreSQL validation

actor Operator
participant "Deployment workflow\n(deploy.yml)" as Workflow
participant "Backend validation job" as BackendTests
participant "Frontend validation job" as FrontendTests
database "Runner PostgreSQL 18\n(ephemeral / isolated)" as RunnerDB
participant "SYS08 backup evidence" as Backup
participant "Previous known-good API image" as PreviousAPI
participant "DEI VM deploy agent" as Deploy
participant "VM release manifest" as Metadata
participant "Versioned runtime configuration" as Config
database "Shared DEI PostgreSQL 18" as DEIDB
participant "Candidate Back-End API" as API
participant "Nginx" as Nginx
participant "GitHub artifacts" as Artifacts

Operator -> Workflow: Schedule or dispatch deploy
Workflow -> Workflow: Queue in `dei-release`; acquire slot
Workflow -> Workflow: Resolve and validate candidate commit SHA
Workflow -> BackendTests: Run backend checks with RUN_DATABASE_TESTS=1
BackendTests -> RunnerDB: Apply migrations and execute PostgreSQL suites
RunnerDB --> BackendTests: Database tests pass
BackendTests --> Workflow: Backend gate passes
Workflow -> FrontendTests: Run lint, Jest, health integration, build and bundle scan
FrontendTests --> Workflow: Frontend gate passes
note over BackendTests,RunnerDB
  Candidate tests use only the ephemeral runner database.
  The shared DEI PostgreSQL service is not contacted by CI tests.
end note

Workflow -> Deploy: Verify SSH host key; stage candidate images and manifest
Deploy -> Metadata: Preserve current release and schema version
Metadata --> Deploy: Current known-good SHA/config/schema version

alt Candidate contains a pending database migration
  Deploy -> Backup: Require confirmed, restorable SYS08 backup
  alt Backup not confirmed
    Backup --> Deploy: No confirmation
    break Stop deploy before shared migration or candidate activation
      Deploy --> Workflow: Report backup gate failure
      Workflow -> Artifacts: Archive sanitized gate failure and test results
    end
  else Backup confirmed
    Backup --> Deploy: Backup confirmation and identifier
    Deploy -> RunnerDB: Create separate scratch DB at current schema version
    Deploy -> RunnerDB: Apply candidate migration to scratch DB
    RunnerDB --> Deploy: Migrated scratch schema ready
    Deploy -> PreviousAPI: Transfer retained image over verified SSH; verify image ID
    Deploy -> PreviousAPI: Run backward-compatibility suite against scratch DB
    alt Previous API compatibility fails
      PreviousAPI --> Deploy: Compatibility failure
      break Stop before shared DEI migration/activation
        Deploy --> Workflow: Report compatibility gate failure
        Workflow -> Artifacts: Archive sanitized failure evidence
      end
    else Previous API compatibility passes
      PreviousAPI --> Deploy: Reads and writes pass on migrated schema
      Deploy -> DEIDB: Apply versioned migration to shared DEI database
      DEIDB --> Deploy: Migration succeeds
    end
  end
else No migration pending
  Deploy -> Deploy: Keep current schema version
end

Deploy -> Config: Select installed configuration revision for candidate
Config --> Deploy: Provide matching runtime configuration
Deploy -> API: Activate candidate API image
API -> DEIDB: Startup connectivity check (SELECT 1)
DEIDB --> API: Connection succeeds; API starts
Deploy -> Nginx: docker compose up -d; replace web/API containers
note over Deploy,Nginx: Single-host replacement may briefly interrupt requests.
Nginx -> API: GET /api/v1/health and routed API smoke checks
API --> Nginx: HTTP 200
Nginx --> Deploy: HTTPS prerequisite, SPA fallback and proxy checks pass
Deploy -> Metadata: Record candidate SHA, image IDs, config and schema version
Deploy --> Workflow: Release active; prior release retained
Workflow -> Artifacts: Archive sanitized logs, tests and release manifest
Workflow --> Operator: Deployment successful; release queue slot released

note over Workflow,DEIDB
  `main.yml` and `deploy.yml` are separate workflows.
  `deploy.yml` repeats validation steps and requires RUN_DATABASE_TESTS=1.
  Runner PostgreSQL is isolated; only deployment migration/runtime traffic
  reaches the shared DEI database.
end note
@enduml
